{"results":[{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/CGzjq50A0Ur/","final_url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/CGzjq50A0Ur/","title":"⚽ Fútbol Updated | 2k+ on Instagram: \"Paul Pogba has denied claims that he has quite the French national team, branding the story as ‘unacceptable fake news’.\nReports in the Middle East claimed the Manchester United midfielder had stepped down from international football after comments from France’s president Emmanuel Macron alleging that Islam was the source of international terrorism.\n[News: Metro UK]\n[Picture: Paul Pogba]\n--------------------------------------------------\n#football #soccer #nfl #sports #futbol #fifa #sport #calcio #premierleague #messi #championsleague #ronaldo #like #cr #follow #futebol #love #seriea #realmadrid #basketball #nike #laliga #f #goal #neymar #bhfyp #barcelona #instagram #juventus #bringbackpremierleaguenewsforyou\"","description":"47 likes, 21 comments - futbol.upd on October 26, 2020: \"Paul Pogba has denied claims that he has quite the French national team, branding the story as ‘unacceptable fake news’.\nReports in the Middle East claimed the Manchester United midfielder had stepped down from international football after comments from France’s president Emmanuel Macron alleging that Islam was the source of international terrorism.\n[News: Metro UK]\n[Picture: Paul Pogba]\n--------------------------------------------------\n#football #soccer #nfl #sports #futbol #fifa #sport #calcio #premierleague #messi #championsleague #ronaldo #like #cr #follow #futebol #love #seriea #realmadrid #basketball #nike #laliga #f #goal #neymar #bhfyp #barcelona #instagram #juventus #bringbackpremierleaguenewsforyou\". ","language":"en","text":"Paul Pogba has denied claims that he has quite the French national team, branding the story as ‘unacceptable fake news’.  \nReports in the Middle East claimed the Manchester United midfielder had stepped down from international football after comments from France’s president Emmanuel Macron alleging that Islam was the source of international terrorism.  \n[News: Metro UK]  \n[Picture: Paul Pogba]  \n--------------------------------------------------  \n#football #soccer #nfl #sports #futbol #fifa #sport #calcio #premierleague #messi #championsleague #ronaldo #like #cr #follow #futebol #love #seriea #realmadrid #basketball #nike #laliga #f #goal #neymar #bhfyp #barcelona #instagram #juventus #bringbackpremierleaguenewsforyou\n\nReports in the Middle East claimed the Manchester United midfielder had stepped down from international football after comments from France’s president Emmanuel Macron alleging that Islam was the source of international terrorism.\n\n[News: Metro UK]\n\n[Picture: Paul Pogba]\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\n#football #soccer #nfl #sports #futbol #fifa #sport #calcio #premierleague #messi #championsleague #ronaldo #like #cr #follow #futebol #love #seriea #realmadrid #basketball #nike #laliga #f #goal #neymar #bhfyp #barcelona #instagram #juventus #bringbackpremierleaguenewsforyou\n\nTypical English media\n\n1 like\n\nReply\n\nThe Sun 🤣\n\n1 like\n\nReply\n\nShocking from the sun\n\n1 like\n\nReply\n\nThe world is crazy. We just can't trust any of the news media. They all manipulate things to what they want to report on. And it's happening more & more from media companies all around the world. It's an absolute disgrace. Our world is turning very negative because of all the miss-information.\n\n1 like\n\nReply\n\nReply\n\nWould respect his decision if he does quit. No religion or race deserves to be discriminated against. We are all humans after all ❤️\n\nReply\n\nFake news everywhere 😭\n\nReply\n\nFrance😠\n\n1 like\n\nReply\n\nReply\n\nHe should of quit\n\n1 like\n\nReply\n\nReply\n\nLog in to like or comment.","author":null,"published_date":"2020-10-26T11:54:17.000Z","latency_ms":7107.533984002657,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}